        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.64,
          "end": 175.46,
          "en": "And for this, we wanna set up navigation from scratch again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.46,
          "end": 178.45,
          "en": "Now the first thing we need to do for this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.45,
          "end": 180.55,
          "en": "is that we need to import something",
